OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry. The rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be largely dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods and the odd shower in the
OL,9,Fnorth.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,12,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,13,Fsome sunny spells.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,16,Fover the weekend with occasional rain,
OL,17,Fthis more widespread for a time on
OL,18,FSunday. Dry on Monday.
